    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Hang the basket from the base of the balloon using the four yarn ropes. The balloon stands with its flat closing point at the base so the balloon appears to float above. Add a hanging loop of chain at the very top if using as a decoration."
        }
